{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Gil looks at the two, and focuses on Muninn \"I don't quite understand what you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:02:03.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878806193559191612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You have taken on the Faith of your people. Tell us why.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:02:30.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878806305643577354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I never gave up on them...  I care about them all...  All that I have been through... all the pains I have endured... I have never given up on them.  I never will.... I want them to see each other the way I see them.... unending.... un-breaking.  Resolute.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:04:35.136000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-22T01:04:38.845000Z","id":"878806827578576937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"This is why you have protected them. The gathering of faith brings to yourself the ferver and the prayers. When you cross, what will become of those you have gathered?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:05:44.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878807118008975441","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"He thinks about the question \"They will continue praying to me.... passing on my words.... They will continue the message I started...\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:07:21.663000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878807526043418634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I hope I live on within them.... I wish to protect them even after I go... and my legacy is all I can leave them\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:08:27.160000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878807800757776424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"There are certain implications. Ones upon which this land was founded. Is this an attempt at apotheosis? Do you seek to attain godhood.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:09:37.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878808097647394896","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yes... I have wanted it for some time.  My goal is to be their source for all time..... I don't know if I will succeed, but I will never give up on them, and thus that goal\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:13:14.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878809005412200458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Be warned Sandigil. Godhood within the bounds of the border is an event that will cause your expulsion from these lands, thrown to wars of the Gods of the Old world. Wisdom is in restraint.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:14:29.894000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878809322174427166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"These are the lands I wish to look after... these people.... what other path can I take to achieve my goals?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:15:23.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878809547949633536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The path of restraint.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:17:16.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878810022191194142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The power to become a god, but the wisdom to remain under.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:17:57.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878810192370888724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The breeze picks up, from beyond the gate, a little old lady enters the grove.","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:18:26.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878810315385618432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
