{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Gil looks shocked. He sees who is joining and its now dawning on him","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:27:45.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878812659007508510","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Your death will not be death. It will be a choice of paths. Charon will not accept your Drachma.\" Says the Warden of Life, Fontaine. Upon whose hands rest a spider of Web and a spider of Anansi.","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:28:07.952000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-22T01:28:26.048000Z","id":"878812753358360587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Fenris and Geri, Hunnin and Muninn bare witness to this historic event.","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:29:05.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878812996506353684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
