{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Lucy lands on Bo's shoulder... They both keep quiet and watch.","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:31:12.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878813526439895111","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"At the time of your passing. Take the other path. Avoid the Ambrosia, the Lotus, and the Apple of life. Will yourself to return. Border Keeper, Sandigil Warden of the Waters. Your words shall be Hupomene the Mender. He who remains under his task\" Says Fontaine. \n\"Unbending.\" Agrees Columbia. \n\"Unyeilding.\" Adds Oro \n\"Enduring.\" Says Cascadia, completing the declaration.","created_at":"2021-08-22T01:33:04.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878813996109664306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
